('node-7-30', 'phase-07-lesson-30-infrastructure-as-code-iac-with-terraform', 'module-10', 30, 'Lesson 10.30: Infrastructure as Code (IaC) with Terraform: Core Mechanics & State', 'Prerequisites: Phase 1, Lesson 7.27', 'Prerequisites: Phase 1, Lesson 7.27 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 240, 8, 1750.0, 1500.0, '# Lesson 7.30: Infrastructure as Code (IaC) with Terraform: Core Mechanics & State

